:''For the harder version, see [[Cat Jobs (Veteran)|Wednesday Blitz Stage]].''
The '''Wednesday Stage''' (水曜ステージ, ''Suiyō Sutēji'', '''Wednesday Stage''') contains three levels, each with a chance to drop a [[Battle Items#Cat Jobs|Cat Jobs]] when completed. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.3 Update|Version 2.0.3]].

